16%} — directly testing the conv-literature, ResNeXt grouped-conv, and information-
bottleneck recommendations against the biological 1–5% intra-minicolumn estimate. The
disagreement between ML theory (25–40% private optimal) and biology (1–5% private) is
principled — biology can afford low private % because neurons fire sparsely (~95% silent at
any moment, low interference in shared dims) while RTCC’s experts are always-active
(worst case for shared-dim interference per superposition theory). The sweep empirically
locates RTCC’s optimum within this tension.
